#: includes/admin/class-jp4wc-security-notice.php:200
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The vulnerability data could not be downloaded, so the installed plugins, "
"themes and WordPress are not being checked. Make sure this server can "
"connect to %s, or turn the vulnerability check off in the JP4WC settings."
