msgstr "チェックの結果"

#. translators: %d: number of checks
#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid "%d checks: ID and result only, never the settings behind them"
msgstr "%d 件のチェック（ID と結果だけで、元になった設定値は送信しません）"

#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid "Revenue and order bands"
msgstr "売上・注文規模の帯"

#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid "Version of the consent text"
msgstr "同意文の版"

#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid "Format of the data"
msgstr "データ形式の版"

#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid "Site identification token"
msgstr "サイト識別トークン"

#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid ""
"Sent: the token wc.artws.info issued to this site on its first check. Its "
"value is not shown."
msgstr ""
"送信します。初回の診断で wc.artws.info がこのサイトに発行したトークンです。値"
"は表示しません。"

#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid ""
"Not sent with the first check: wc.artws.info issues it then, and it is sent "
"with later checks and with the deletion. Its value is not shown."
msgstr ""
"初回の診断では送信しません。そのときに wc.artws.info が発行し、2 回目以降の診"
"断とデータの削除で送信します。値は表示しません。"

#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid "Report of the free security check"
msgstr "無料セキュリティ診断のレポート"

#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:4
msgid "Save as PDF"
msgstr "PDF で保存"

#. translators: %s: date and time of the check
#: assets/js/build/admin/settings.js:5
